/// Asks for an ATT MTU of mtu bytes (23-517, else InvalidArgument).
/// callback(error_code, message, connection, mtu), mtu the MTU now in effect, which
/// the peer may have lowered. Android negotiates it (LeMtuRequest). Windows and Apple
/// negotiate the MTU themselves when the link opens: the callback fires at once with
