/// Starts an asynchronous characteristic read.
/// callback(error_code, message, characteristic, value, size). value is a value
/// handle holding the bytes read (0, with size 0, on failure); copy them with
/// bluetooth_le_value_copy(). Apple reports reads and notifications through one
/// delegate call, so on a subscribed characteristic a notification arriving while
/// the read is in flight can be what the read returns.
